OL,3,GNEWSAPortsmouth small boats protest 'a
OL,4,Awake-up call for government', local
OL,5,Apolice commissioner says
OL,6,
OL,7,FA protest against small boat crossings
OL,8,Fin Portsmouth last night is a "wake-up
OL,9,Fcall" for the government, the local
OL,10,FConservative police commissioner says
OL,12,FHundreds of people protested after 140
OL,13,Fmigrants were brought to shore in
OL,14,FHampshire - much further west than
OL,15,Fwhere small boats usually arrive
OL,17,FThe government condemned "intimidating
OL,18,Fand thuggish behaviour" at the protest
OL,19,F- Commissioner Donna Jones says while
OL,20,Fcrimes were committed, "hundreds" were
OL,21,Facting lawfully
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,336,330,200,160,0,100
