OL,3,GNEWSAPortsmouth small boats protest 'a
OL,4,Awake-up call for government', local
OL,5,Apolice commissioner says
OL,6,
OL,7,FOne protester in Portsmouth tells the
OL,8,FBBC people are "absolutely fed up" with
OL,9,Fsmall boat arrivals
OL,11,FAnother person who saw the migrants
OL,12,Farrive tells us it was a "very strange
OL,13,Fscene to witness" - while adding some
OL,14,Fprotesters' views made her "genuinely
OL,15,Funsettled"
OL,17,FIt's thought more than 500 migrants
OL,18,Fcrossed the Channel in small boats
OL,19,Fyesterday - although overall, figures
OL,20,Fare down in 2026
